# DETECTION PLUGIN - which node is this booting MAC?
#
#        switchport.py, two defined methods are mandatory:
#        - find   receives a MAC, returns True,switch,port on success, False on no success
#        - scan   runs through a dict of switches. collects ports+macs
#
#        cloud.py, one defined method is mandatory:
#        - find   receives a MAC, returns the cloud name
#
# Both are loaded by name, plugins/boot/detection/switchport.py and
# plugins/boot/detection/cloud.py. There is no search path and no default.
